/* Legal: privacy */
"No account, no collection" = "无账号、不收集";
"POPOPX creates no accounts. Your profiles, contacts, groups, messages and settings exist only in the encrypted database on this device, and nothing here links who talks to whom." = "POPOPX 不创建账号。你的身份、联系人、群组、消息与设置只存在于本机加密数据库中，任何数据都不会把谁在和谁说话拼在一起。";
"Encrypted relay queues" = "加密中继队列";
"Online messages travel through the dynamic SMP relay node cluster. Queues are encrypted end to end, so a relay node sees neither message content nor both ends of a conversation, and it keeps no history of delivered messages." = "在线消息经由动态 SMP 中继节点集群转发。队列全程端到端加密，中继节点既看不到消息内容，也无法同时获知通信两端，且不保留已投递消息的历史。";
