"This build bundles no analytics or crash-reporting SDK and no telemetry collector. The status you see in the header describes the nodes your own device is talking to, not you." = "本构建不内置任何统计分析或崩溃上报 SDK，也没有遥测采集器。顶栏状态只描述本机正在连接的节点，不描述你。";
"Credentials stay on device" = "凭证只留在本机";
