"Push token and replay protection" = "推送令牌与防重放";
"Push delivery uses an Apple device token bound to the notification mode you chose. The token carries no message content, is reissued when you change server or mode, and is used once so a captured token cannot be replayed." = "推送使用与你所选通知模式绑定的 Apple 设备令牌。令牌不含任何消息内容，在更换服务器或通知模式时重新签发，且一次一用，被截获也无法重放。";
"The camera guard stays local" = "防偷窥相机仅本地处理";
"The anti-peeping guard switches the front camera on only while a top-secret sheet is open, at the lowest resolution, processes every frame on this device and stops the stream when the sheet closes. Nothing is written to disk and nothing is uploaded." = "防旁观引擎只在绝密弹窗打开期间启用前置摄像头，取最低分辨率，每一帧只在本机处理，弹窗关闭立即停止采集。不写盘，也不上传。";
