"The drill only feeds fixed synthetic samples into the very same detection code the real runtime uses. It does not lock the screen, does not wipe, and does not read the sensors on the phone in your hand." = "演练只把固定的合成样本喂给真实运行时使用的同一套检测代码。它不会锁屏、不会抹除，也不会读取你手上这台手机的传感器。";
"The drill uses a read-only comparison and does not consult the cool-down table, so this sentence can never appear on this page: it exists only because that result has one more possibility and the compiler requires the cases to be exhaustive. The row on the lock screen is where the cool-down actually lands." = "演练用的是只读比对，不查冷却表，所以这句话在本页永远不会出现：它存在只是因为那个结果多一种可能，而编译器要求分支穷举。锁定界面上的那一行才是冷却真正落地的地方。";
"The drill will not really wipe: this row only asks which code the typed one matches, using the verification-only method; the path that leads to a wipe is not called here." = "演练不会真的抹除：这一行只用「仅验证」的方式判断输入的是哪个码；通向抹除的那条路径在这里不会被调用。";
"The duress code cannot be the same as the normal code" = "胁迫密码不能与常规密码相同";
"The duress code record is deleted from secure storage at once, and after that no input can trigger an erasure. The normal code stays. Switching it back on means setting both codes again." = "胁迫密码记录会立即从安全存储删除，此后任何输入都触发不了抹除。常规密码保留。重新开启需要再次设置这两个密码。";
"The encrypted service has stopped. Start it in Settings → Chat data, or restart the app; chats cannot be opened until it runs." = "加密服务已停止。请在 设置 → 聊天数据 中启动，或重启 app；它运行之前无法打开会话。";
"The encrypted service is starting; chats open in a moment." = "加密服务正在启动，稍等即可打开会话。";
