"The group name is the line shown in the chat list; the display name and the one-line summary appear only when you open the group profile." = "群名称是会话列表里显示的那一行；显示名称与一行摘要只在你打开群资料时才会出现。";
"The guarantee is a type-level one in the implementation: this page only calls the static pure functions of the detection code and verify(pin:), and the latter is defined to have zero side effects; the method that leads to a wipe has no reference anywhere on this page." = "这份保证在实现上是类型层面的：本页只调用检测代码的静态纯函数和 verify(pin:)，而后者被定义为零副作用；通向抹除的方法在本页没有任何引用。";
"The guard is switched off in settings" = "防护已在设置里关闭";
"The highest tier in the group; you hold it yourself because you created the group." = "群组里的最高档；因为群是你创建的，所以由你自己持有。";
"The ledger and the balance on this device do not add up. The balance is still the sum of the ledger, but hold off on large exchanges until a reconciliation has run." = "本机的账本与余额对不上。余额仍等于账本之和，但在完成一次对账之前，请暂缓大额兑换。";
