"The offline connection failed; please try again later" = "离线连接失败，请稍后再试";
"The one-time connection is deleted right after; neither device keeps a contact record." = "一次性连接随后即被删除；两台设备都不保留联系人记录。";
"The only way out when you forget the entry passcode: type these 12 English words correctly on the lock screen and you can set a new entry passcode. The phrase is generated on this device, and secure storage keeps both its derived value for the lock screen to compare and the readable text, which exists only so this page can show it again." = "忘记入口密码时唯一的出路：在锁定界面正确输入这 12 个英文单词，就能重设新的入口密码。助记词由本机生成，安全存储同时保存供锁定界面比对的派生值和可读文本，而可读文本的存在只是为了让本页能再次显示它。";
"The other device is the same identity as this one" = "对方设备与本机是同一个身份";
"The other side confirms the voucher has not been redeemed yet, then signs an authorization and sends it back." = "对方确认这张兑换券尚未被兑换，然后签回一份授权。";
"The other side left the near field" = "对方已离开近场";
"The packet has to reach the other device: while it is undelivered the credits stay on your entry here and can be resent unchanged." = "红包必须送达对方设备：未送达期间点数仍挂在你的记录上，可以原样重发。";
"The pairing policy is silent: the nearby exchange binds on its own when it finishes, so only requests that have not settled are listed here." = "配对策略是静默的：附近交换完成时会自动绑定，所以这里只列出尚未落定的请求。";
"The payload is damaged and cannot be opened" = "载荷已损坏，无法打开";
"The payload was not usable, so nothing was sent." = "载荷不可用，因此没有发送任何内容。";
"The plain-text card is %1$lld bytes, over the %2$lld byte limit for a single Bluetooth Mesh message; trim the text and try again." = "明文卡片有 %1$lld 字节，超过单条蓝牙 Mesh 消息 %2$lld 字节的上限；请精简文本后重试。";
"The plaintext and the originals were cleared, but this device's message row could not be deleted; open the chat again to confirm" = "明文与原件都已清除，但本机的这条消息记录没能删除；请重新打开会话确认。";
"The plaintext was erased from memory, but this device could not locate the record: it was not deleted." = "明文已从内存中抹除，但本机没能定位到那条记录：它没有被删除。";
