"The profile mode this code will distribute" = "这个码将要分发的身份模式";
"The public network is slow — also sending over Bluetooth mesh (%@)" = "公网较慢 —— 同时经蓝牙 Mesh 发送（%@）";
"The public network is unavailable — messages go over Bluetooth mesh" = "公网不可用 —— 消息走蓝牙 Mesh";
