"The read failed, please try again later" = "读取失败，请稍后再试";
"The reading window for this profile page has expired" = "这个资料页的查看时长已到期";
"The reading window starts counting when the friend opens it; when it ends, the content on this device and the image and video originals are destroyed together." = "查看时长从好友打开的那一刻开始计时；计时结束时，本机的内容与图片、视频原件一起销毁。";
"The record on this device was deleted and the other side was notified." = "本机的记录已删除，并已通知对方。";
"The record on this device was deleted, with %lld notifications sent." = "本机的记录已删除，共发出 %lld 条通知。";
"The record on this device was deleted." = "本机的记录已删除。";
"The records of both codes were deleted" = "两个密码的记录都已删除";
"The records of the normal code and of the duress code are both deleted, and the lock screen falls back to only the app's own authentication gate. This step cannot be undone, but it deletes no chat data." = "常规密码与胁迫密码的记录都已删除，锁定界面退回只走 app 自己的验证闸门。这一步无法撤销，但不会删除任何聊天数据。";
"The recovery phrase is incorrect" = "恢复助记词不正确";
"The recovery phrase needs 12 standard English words; check them word by word and try again" = "恢复助记词需要 12 个标准英文单词；请逐词核对后重试。";
"The relay host names can be copied to troubleshoot connection problems." = "中继主机名可以复制，用于排查连接问题。";
"The relay is used only when it is necessary; the other side may see your IP address." = "只在必要时才使用中继；对方可能看到你的 IP 地址。";
