"The reset did not complete; try again later" = "重置未完成，请稍后再试";
"The risk is still there. Closing destroys this message." = "风险仍然存在。关闭即销毁这条消息。";
"The router no longer has a delivery record for this card (%@); please send it again." = "路由器已没有这张卡（%@）的投递记录；请重新发送。";
"The same price turned into a voucher you can send away; exchange several at once if you want." = "同一个价格换成可转赠的兑换券；想的话可以一次兑换好几张。";
"The screen is being recorded or mirrored" = "屏幕正在录制或被投屏";
"The screen is being recorded or mirrored, so it was refused" = "屏幕正在录制或被投屏，因此已拒绝";
"The screen is being recorded or mirrored, so opening was refused" = "屏幕正在录制或被投屏，因此拒绝打开";
"The screen is judged suspicious and locked only when the angle stays past the chosen threshold for at least %1$@ s and there are at least %3$@ irregular touches inside %2$@ s. Smaller is more sensitive, and the price of a wrong call is one extra authentication." = "只有当视线角度持续超过所选阈值至少 %1$@ 秒，且在 %2$@ 秒内出现至少 %3$@ 次异常触摸时，屏幕才判定为可疑并锁定。数值越小越灵敏，误判的代价只是多验证一次。";
"The secure module is not ready, so the secure content was refused" = "安全模块尚未就绪，因此已拒绝提供安全内容";
"The secure store on this device could not be reached, and no credits moved." = "无法访问本机的安全存储，点数没有任何变动。";
"The sender set a gate of %1$lld Compute Credits on this copy; your balance is %2$lld Compute Credits. The unlock record is written only into this device's keychain." = "发送方在这份内容上设了 %1$lld 算力点的门槛；你的余额为 %2$lld 算力点。解锁记录只写入本机钥匙串。";
"The sensor tests will definitely report false positives: going over a speed bump, throwing the phone into a bag or knocking it on a table corner can all hit. Precisely because they do, their consequence is always limited to one more authentication and can never lead to a wipe." = "传感器检测一定会误报：过减速带、把手机扔进包里、磕到桌角都可能触发。正因为如此，它们的后果永远只是多验证一次，绝不会通向抹除。";
"The sensors are sampling at 20Hz. Sampling stops the moment the screen locks, and also when the app moves to the background." = "传感器正以 20Hz 采样。屏幕一锁定就停止采样，app 进入后台时同样停止。";
"The signature could not be obtained: the credits stay with this packet and are returned automatically when the grace period ends." = "未能取得签名：点数仍随这个红包保留，宽限期结束后会自动退回。";
"The signature does not verify: this code is not the voucher that was issued." = "签名校验不通过：这个码不是签发的那张兑换券。";
"The signature does not verify: this is not the entry published by the channel owner." = "签名校验不通过：这不是频道主发布的那条记录。";
"The signature does not verify: this is not the voucher that was issued." = "签名校验不通过：这不是签发的那张兑换券。";
"The signature for this voucher was not created: this device's signing key is unavailable." = "未能生成这张兑换券的签名：本机签名密钥不可用。";
"The signing key does not match the publisher recorded on this device from your last payment: either someone forwarded this card, or the channel owner changed devices." = "签名密钥与本机上次付款时记录的发布方不符：要么这张卡被人转手，要么频道主换了设备。";
"The store cannot be read right now: cards still show their list prices, and buying works again once the network is back." = "当前读不到商店：卡片仍显示标价，网络恢复后即可正常购买。";
"The subscription did not go through" = "订阅未通过";
"The tap-and-pass link did not go out" = "轻触传递链接没有发出去";
"The threshold guards admission on this device only; it does not change who the channel itself can broadcast to." = "门槛只在本机把守准入，不改变频道本身能向谁广播。";
"The threshold is set by the owner on their profile card; the unlock keeps a receipt on this device." = "门槛由主人在自己的名片上设定；解锁回执保存在本机。";
"The threshold written on this card is 0." = "这张卡上写的门槛是 0。";
"The ticket expires on %@. After that, this page will ask for credits again." = "票据于 %@ 到期。之后本页会再次收取点数。";
"The ticket lives only in this device's Keychain: no server validates it, and none is needed." = "票据只存在本机钥匙串里：没有服务器来验证它，也不需要。";
"The timer only looks at whether anything touches the screen. Once it is locked the timer stops; it does not keep counting behind the lock screen." = "计时器只看屏幕有没有被触碰。一旦锁定计时即停止，不会在锁屏后面继续累计。";
"The title is too long (%1$lld characters, limit %2$lld)" = "标题过长（%1$lld 个字符，上限 %2$lld）";
"The top bar shows this badge: it appears only while the badge is active and is withdrawn when it expires." = "顶栏会显示这枚徽章：只在徽章有效期间出现，到期即撤回。";
"The top secret message cannot be opened; this device cannot locate the record" = "无法打开这条绝密消息，本机定位不到该记录";
"The top secret message is damaged and cannot be opened" = "绝密消息已损坏，无法打开";
"The two entries do not match" = "两次输入不一致";
"The two entries match" = "两次输入一致";
"The underlying identity list could not be read: the chat core is unavailable right now, or this device really has no identity at all. Close this page and enter again, or first go back to the home page and check that the account is ready." = "无法读取底层身份列表：聊天核心当前不可用，或者本机确实一个身份都没有。请关闭本页重新进入，或先回首页确认账户已就绪。";
"The voucher lives in this device's Keychain, and the check that it can be redeemed only once is on this device too. There is no voucher server, so there is no loss report, no remote revocation and no delivery receipt." = "兑换券存放在本机钥匙串里，只能兑换一次的校验也在本机完成。没有兑换券服务器，因此没有挂失、没有远程撤销，也没有送达回执。";
"The way it is being handled does not match you, locked" = "持握方式与你不符，已锁定";
"The whole screen is heavily blurred; only the circle under your finger stays sharp. Let go and it all blurs back." = "整屏高度模糊，只有手指下方的那一圈保持清晰；一松手就全部重新糊掉。";
"The word list is the standard BIP-39 English list of 2048 words, and the 12 words are derived from 16 random bytes plus a 4-bit checksum, so the order and the spelling both have to be copied exactly. The derivation uses PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 100,000 iterations, so one tap waits about a third of a second and that is not a hang; the Face ID button waits for the system sheet, which is not a hang either." = "词表是标准的 BIP-39 英文 2048 词表，12 个词由 16 字节随机数加上 4 位校验和推导而来，所以顺序与拼写都必须精确照抄。推导使用 PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256、10 万次迭代，因此轻触一次要等约三分之一秒，这不是卡死；Face ID 按钮在等系统弹窗，那也不是卡死。";
"The write failed, please try again later" = "写入失败，请稍后再试";
"Their device has not appeared in the mesh for a long time" = "对方设备已很久没在组网里出现";
"Their device has not exchanged mesh cards with yours; move closer once, or send over the internet" = "对方设备还没有与本机交换过组网名片；请靠近一次，或经公网发送";
"Their invitation was accepted; waiting for them to let you in" = "已接受 TA 发来的邀请；正在等待对方放行";
"There are no contacts on this device yet. Create the group first, then let people join through the group link." = "本机还没有联系人。请先创建群组，再通过群链接让人加入。";
"There are no contacts to invite yet. After the group exists you can let people join through the group link." = "还没有可邀请的联系人。群组建好后，你可以用群链接让别人加入。";
"There is no interface available to show this profile page in" = "当前没有可显示这个资料页的界面";
"There is no internet right now and the Bluetooth mesh cannot carry this card either: %@" = "当前没有网络，蓝牙 Mesh 也带不动这张卡：%@";
"These connections are not contacts yet, so they stay out of the contacts list and cannot be opened." = "这些连接还算不上联系人，因此不进联系人列表，也无法打开。";
"These credits are still recorded in your name; whatever is unclaimed when a packet expires goes back to your balance." = "这些点数仍记在你的名下；红包到期时无人领取的部分会退回你的余额。";
"These readings are what the sensor monitor collected itself: the peaks since this run started, and a conclusion only after a verdict has hit once. They are not the two numbers the drill computes." = "这些读数是传感器监视器自己采集的：本次运行以来的峰值，以及判定命中一次之后才给出的结论。它们不是演练算出的那两个数值。";
"These two codes exist only as derived values; the plain text is never stored on this device. When you forget the entry passcode the only way out is the 12 English words you copied down by hand, and the mnemonic phrase itself has no recovery channel at all, so this write generates one on the way. Whether you copy it down is your call. That one tap in the confirmation dialog is the last gate on this consequence." = "这两个密码只以派生值存在，明文从不保存在本机。忘记入口密码时唯一的出路，是你亲手抄下的那 12 个英文单词；助记词本身没有任何恢复渠道，所以这次写入会顺手生成一组。要不要抄下来由你决定。确认弹窗里的那一次轻触，就是这个后果之前的最后一道闸门。";
"They see this number first when they open the card, and it is only then taken from the balance on their own device. Empty or 0 is free to view; the limit is %lld and a larger number snaps to it. The threshold travels with the card - neither side of POPOPX can change it for them." = "对方打开卡片时先看到的就是这个数字，而且到那一刻才从他们自己的余额里扣。留空或 0 为免费查看；上限是 %lld，更大的数会自动取到上限。门槛随卡片一起传递，POPOPX 的任何一方都改不了它。";
"They type this code into the app or scan it, and this device creates a one-time SMP connection by itself." = "对方把这个码输进 app 或扫一下，本机就会自动创建一条一次性 SMP 连接。";
"This card (%@) is already in the relay queue, so it was not submitted twice." = "这张卡（%@）已经在中继队列里，所以没有重复提交。";
"This card was destroyed; nothing is kept on this device" = "这张卡已销毁；本机不保留任何内容";
"This channel is free" = "这个频道免费";
"This chat does not allow sending messages right now." = "当前这个会话不允许发送消息。";
"This chat has been deleted, or it has not finished loading." = "这个会话已被删除，或者还没加载完。";
"This chat is not a 1-to-1 direct chat" = "这个会话不是单聊直连";
"This code cannot be decoded: it may be truncated, mistyped, or not from this version." = "这个码无法解码：可能被截断、输错，或者不属于当前版本。";
"This code is armed: they get this tier automatically once the scan connects" = "这个码已备好推送：扫码连上后对方会自动获得这一档";
"This code only opens the door; it does the same job as the app passcode gate upstream." = "这个码只开门；它与上游的 app 密码闸门做的是同一件事。";
"This code opens the door and at the same time erases the identities on this device. It is rejected outright if it equals the normal code." = "这个码开门的同时会抹除本机的身份。若与常规密码相同，会被直接拒绝。";
"This connection has been verified by its security code" = "这条连接已用其安全码验证过";
"This connection was not made with your main profile." = "这条连接不是用你的主身份建立的。";
"This contact cannot be invited" = "无法邀请该联系人";
"This contact cannot be invited into the group" = "无法把该联系人邀请进群";
"This contact has no mesh binding yet" = "该联系人还没有组网绑定";
"This device could not record the claim — try again later, or check the device's free storage." = "本机无法记录这次领取 —— 请稍后再试，或检查设备剩余存储空间。";
"This device does not allow opening secure messages right now." = "本机当前不允许打开安全消息。";
"This device does not support the 640×480 export preset" = "本机不支持 640×480 导出预设";
"This device first verifies the signature inside the code, then connects to the gifter's device and sends the redemption request." = "本机先验证码内的签名，然后连接赠送方的设备并发出兑换请求。";
"This device has no front camera" = "本机没有前置摄像头";
"This device has no mnemonic phrase yet. Generate one and copy the 12 English words onto paper right there and then." = "本机还没有助记词。请生成一组，并当场把 12 个英文单词抄到纸上。";
"This device has no normal code set yet, so there is no record to compare against." = "本机还没有设置常规密码，因此没有可比对的记录。";
"This device has no precise ranging: stay within 1 metre and the cards exchange themselves once linked" = "本机没有精确测距：请保持在 1 米内，连上后名片会自动交换";
"This device has no trace of where the record was stored, so the message cannot be located" = "本机已查不到该记录存放位置的痕迹，因此无法定位这条消息";
"This device has no unlock passcode yet — unlock first, then turn it on under Settings." = "本机还没有解锁密码 —— 请先解锁，再到设置里打开。";
"This device has no usable Face ID or Touch ID, so the lock screen asks straight for the 6-digit keypad code." = "本机没有可用的 Face ID 或 Touch ID，所以锁定界面直接要求输入 6 位键盘密码。";
"This device has no usable biometrics, so secure messages cannot be opened" = "本机没有可用的生物识别，因此无法打开安全消息";
"This device has no usable identity; turn on Cabin in Settings first" = "本机没有可用的身份；请先在设置里开启厢语";
"This device is being traced by a debugger, so opening was refused" = "本机正被调试器跟踪，因此拒绝打开";
"This device only receives it quietly, nothing to do" = "本机只是静默收到它，无需任何操作";
"This device rejects that threshold (it is 0 or above the allowed maximum); no credits moved." = "本机拒绝这个门槛（它为 0 或超过允许上限）；点数没有变动。";
"This device sends the invitation" = "由本机发出邀请";
"This device still has the app's own entry passcode switched on: when unlocking it shows its keypad once first and POPOPX shows its keypad again, and the two keypads do the same job. Enter it correctly and we turn it off, so from now on only the normal code above is accepted. What goes off with it is the self-destruct code that only that old keypad could accept: once the old keypad is gone it has no way in, and keeping it would only make the row in Privacy and Security read enabled. This step does not rebuild the database keys and not one character of chat data moves; getting it back means setting it up again on the Privacy and Security page." = "本机还开着 app 自己的入口密码：解锁时它会先显示一次自己的键盘，POPOPX 又显示一次键盘，两套键盘做的是同一件事。输入正确我们就把它关掉，从此只接受上面那个常规密码。随之一起关掉的，是只有那套旧键盘才能接受的自毁密码：旧键盘一没，它就再无入口，留着也只会让隐私与安全里那一行显示为已启用。这一步不会重建数据库密钥，聊天数据一个字符也不会动；想恢复就得在隐私与安全页重新设置一遍。";
"This device's Bluetooth key is now bound" = "本机的蓝牙密钥现已绑定";
"This device's camera status is unknown" = "本机相机状态未知";
"This device's clock was changed; the content was destroyed" = "本机的时钟被改过；内容已销毁";
"This device's record" = "本机的记录";
"This did not complete, and no credits were taken." = "这一步没有完成，也未扣除任何点数。";
"This did not complete." = "这一步没有完成。";
"This did not complete; you can try again later." = "这一步没有完成，稍后可以再试。";
"This draft cannot be marked secure while it is being rewritten, forwarded, recorded as a live message or already has an attachment." = "草稿正在改写、转发、录制为实时消息，或已带附件时，无法把它标记为安全消息。";
"This exchange did not take effect; %lld Compute Credits were refunded exactly, and the balance is unchanged." = "本次兑换没有生效；已精确退还 %lld 算力点，余额未变。";
"This image cannot be read; try another one." = "无法读取这张图片；请换一张。";
"This is neither a POPOPX link nor an online invitation link" = "这既不是 POPOPX 链接，也不是在线邀请链接";
"This is not in a channel: a threshold card only counts inside a channel, so no credits are charged here." = "这里不在频道内：门槛卡片只在频道里计数，因此这里不会收取点数。";
"This is the one you sent." = "这是你发出的那一份。";
"This is the threshold you published: credits are charged only when a member taps it." = "这是你发布的门槛：只有成员轻触时才会扣点。";
"This link only sets up a one-time encrypted connection — anyone who gets it can start a connection with you, so do not publish it." = "这个链接只建立一次性加密连接 —— 拿到它的任何人都能与你发起连接，所以不要公开它。";
"This link only sets up a one-time encrypted connection — anyone who gets it can start a connection with you, so do not publish it. The QR code carries no profile content: the content goes out as a single message only after the connection exists." = "这个链接只建立一次性加密连接 —— 拿到它的任何人都能与你发起连接，所以不要公开它。QR 码不含任何资料内容：内容只在连接建立之后作为单条消息发出。";
"This message does not give its text to the screen reader (VoiceOver)." = "这条消息没有把文本交给屏幕阅读器（VoiceOver）。";
"This message has no more content" = "这条消息没有更多内容";
"This message has no time left to extend." = "这条消息已没有可延长的时长。";
"This message was deleted" = "这条消息已删除";
"This one table governs the numeric keypad, Face ID and the mnemonic phrase together, because all three verify the same thing: the owner in person. The first 4 failures only buzz and do not lock; a slip of the finger, or one digit off because of oil on the screen, should not be treated as an attack. The counter lives in secure storage, so it is still there after the process is killed and reopened." = "这一张表同时管着数字键盘、Face ID 与助记词，因为三者验证的是同一件事：机主本人。前 4 次失败只震动、不锁定；手指滑一下，或因屏幕油污输错一位，不该被当成攻击。计数器保存在安全存储里，所以进程被杀掉再打开它仍然存在。";
"This packet did not go through" = "这个红包没有发出去";
"This packet was not delivered" = "这个红包未送达";
"This page runs no connectivity test: there is no server to ask, so there is no decorative check button either." = "本页不跑连通性测试：没有服务器可问，所以也没有那种装饰性的检查按钮。";
"This person's messages will be shown again." = "这个人的消息会重新显示。";
"This person's new messages will be hidden." = "这个人的新消息将被隐藏。";
"This profile cannot be sent for now: %@" = "这个身份暂时无法发送：%@";
"This profile cannot be sent: %@" = "这个身份无法发送：%@";
"This profile has %lld image or video blocks: they are skipped automatically on the offline Bluetooth Mesh path, which sends the text-only version." = "这份身份资料含 %lld 个图片或视频块：在离线蓝牙 Mesh 路径上会自动跳过，只发出纯文本版本。";
"This profile has no content" = "这份身份资料没有内容";
"This profile has no content blocks yet; add text, an image or a video before you can send it." = "这份身份资料还没有内容块；请先添加文本、图片或视频，然后才能发送。";
"This profile holds too much (%1$lld bytes, limit %2$lld): cut some text or media" = "这份身份资料太大（%1$lld 字节，上限 %2$lld）：请删掉一些文本或媒体";
"This profile is text only, so the online and the offline Bluetooth Mesh paths send exactly the same thing." = "这份身份资料只有文本，所以在线与离线蓝牙 Mesh 两条路径发出的东西完全一样。";
"This profile page does not use the front camera watch; only screenshot and screen recording detection stay on." = "这个资料页不使用前置摄像头看护；只保留截屏与录屏检测。";
"This profile page has no content blocks." = "这个资料页没有内容块。";
"This profile page has nothing to show" = "这个资料页没有可显示的内容";
"This profile page requires camera watch; allow camera access first" = "这个资料页需要摄像头看护；请先允许相机访问";
"This profile's burn-after-reading time is not valid (%lld seconds)" = "这份资料的阅后即焚时长无效（%lld 秒）";
"This profile's content encoding is damaged and cannot be read" = "这份资料的内容编码已损坏，无法读取";
"This profile's content structure is damaged and cannot be read" = "这份资料的内容结构已损坏，无法读取";
"This profile's data version is not recognised (%@); POPOPX has to be updated before it can open" = "这份资料的数据版本无法识别（%@）；需要更新 POPOPX 才能打开";
"This profile's delivery mode is not recognised (%@)" = "这份资料的送达方式无法识别（%@）";
"This profile's send mode is not recognised (%@)" = "这份资料的发送方式无法识别（%@）";
"This row decides what kind of account you hand over once the wipe is done. The first option only counts when you name which anonymous identity to keep, and that is identity information, not a preference." = "这一行决定抹除完成后你交出的究竟是什么样的账户。第一个选项只有在你指定要保留哪个匿名身份时才计数，而那属于身份信息，不是偏好设置。";
"This row is only a count kept on this device: while the badge is lit it increases once per fixed interval, and no relay node changes because of it." = "这一行只是本机保存的一个计数：徽章点亮期间它每固定间隔加一次，任何中继节点都不会因此改变。";
"This row only decides which kind of account you hand over; it does not affect the wipe itself. Flipping it makes the simulated decoy generator re-read immediately instead of waiting for its own refresh." = "这一行只决定你交出的是哪一类账户；它不影响抹除本身。切换它会让模拟诱饵生成器立即重新读取，而不用等它自己刷新。";
"This send" = "本次发送";
"This send skips %lld image or video blocks and sends the text-only version." = "本次发送跳过了 %lld 个图片或视频块，只发出纯文本版本。";
"This switch is bound to the behaviour test itself: flipping it starts or stops the sensors on the spot instead of waiting for the next launch. It only escalates to one more authentication and can never lead to erasure." = "这个开关绑定到行为测试本身：一按就当场启动或停止传感器，而不是等下次启动。它最多升级成多验证一次，绝不会引出抹除。";
"This system version does not support face-to-face adding; use Scan QR code instead" = "当前系统版本不支持面对面添加；请改用「扫 QR 码」";
"This threshold is outside the allowed range (from 1 to the maximum; free needs no published threshold)." = "这个门槛超出允许范围（从 1 到最大值；免费不需要发布门槛）。";
"This top-secret message will not open" = "这条绝密消息无法打开";
"This video cannot be read; try another one." = "无法读取这段视频；请换一段。";
