"Why a failure here does not enter the cool-down table: this prompt guards against an owner who got the words wrong, not against someone who holds the phone and guesses. If it counted, the settings page would become a second place to guess at, while an owner who once mis-copies, and getting 12 words out of order is common, would lock themselves into a 1 hour cool-down, exactly in the place where that hurts most. The prompt that really leads to a reset is on the lock screen, and only that one counts." = "这里失败为什么不进入冷却表：这道询问防的是把词抄错的机主，而不是拿着手机乱猜的人。如果计入，设置页就成了第二个可以猜的地方；而抄错过一次的机主 —— 12 个词抄乱顺序很常见 —— 会把自己锁进 1 小时冷却，恰恰在最难受的地方。真正通向重置的询问在锁定界面上，只有那一次才计数。";
