"The connection to this contact could not be established, not even through the relay. Try again; if it keeps failing, the problem is on one of the two networks." = "无法与此联系人建立连接，即使通过中继也失败。请重试；如果一直失败，问题出在双方的网络之一。";
"Calls are set to always use a relay, but no relay is available to this app, so no call can connect. Turn off \"Force calls through a relay\" in call settings." = "通话已设为始终使用中继，但本应用没有可用的中继，因此任何通话都无法接通。请在通话设置中关闭“强制通话走中继”。";
"The call could not find a direct path, which usually means one of the two networks blocks peer-to-peer connections. No relay is configured for this build, so there is nothing to fall back on." = "通话找不到直连路径，这通常意味着双方的某个网络阻止了点对点连接。此构建未配置中继，因此没有可退路。";
"peer-to-peer (server reflexive)" = "点对点（服务器反射地址）";
